comments.content:
Claude suggested this nftables-ipopt config + systemd unit to survive reboot will also fix the issue. Can anyone comment whether this is early enough in the stack to also solve this?  cat > /etc/nftables-ipopt.nft <<'EOF'
  table inet ipopt {
    chain pre {
      type filter hook prerouting priority raw - 10; policy accept;
      ip hdrlength != 5 counter drop
    }
  }
  EOF

Also couldn't get IPv4 packets with options through between Hetzner cloud servers (different networks), but it's no guarantee.

